
. * Native Stata oracle for tab1, tab2, and immediate tabulations.
. * Regenerate from this directory: stata -q -b do tabulate-multiple.do
. set more off

. set linesize 80

. clear

. input x y z

             x          y          z
  1. 1 1 1
  2. 1 2 2
  3. 2 1 3
  4. 2 2 1
  5. 3 . 2
  6. . 3 2
  7. end

. tab1 x y z, missing

-> tabulation of x  

          x |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |          2       33.33       33.33
          2 |          2       33.33       66.67
          3 |          1       16.67       83.33
          . |          1       16.67      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |          6      100.00

-> tabulation of y  

          y |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |          2       33.33       33.33
          2 |          2       33.33       66.67
          3 |          1       16.67       83.33
          . |          1       16.67      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |          6      100.00

-> tabulation of z  

          z |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |          2       33.33       33.33
          2 |          3       50.00       83.33
          3 |          1       16.67      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |          6      100.00

. tab1 x y if z > 1, missing sort

-> tabulation of x if z > 1 

          x |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |          1       25.00       25.00
          2 |          1       25.00       50.00
          3 |          1       25.00       75.00
          . |          1       25.00      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |          4      100.00

-> tabulation of y if z > 1 

          y |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          1 |          1       25.00       25.00
          2 |          1       25.00       50.00
          3 |          1       25.00       75.00
          . |          1       25.00      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |          4      100.00

. tab2 x y z, firstonly chi2

-> tabulation of x by y  

           |           y
         x |         1          2 |     Total
-----------+----------------------+----------
         1 |         1          1 |         2 
         2 |         1          1 |         2 
-----------+----------------------+----------
     Total |         2          2 |         4 

          Pearson chi2(1) =   0.0000   Pr = 1.000

-> tabulation of x by z  

           |                z
         x |         1          2          3 |     Total
-----------+---------------------------------+----------
         1 |         1          1          0 |         2 
         2 |         1          0          1 |         2 
         3 |         0          1          0 |         1 
-----------+---------------------------------+----------
     Total |         2          2          1 |         5 

          Pearson chi2(4) =   3.7500   Pr = 0.441

